it big are slim to none I think for me

00:06:23.880 --> 00:06:28.830
and for most others if you can sit there
and tell yourself that I will I I would

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:33.810
do this for free the rest of my life
working side jobs never gonna make a lot

00:06:33.810 --> 00:06:37.740
of money I'm not gonna have a big house
in Beverly Hills I'm not gonna you know

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:40.740
mingle with the Stars if you can tell
yourself that

00:06:40.740 --> 00:06:45.360
I would be happy just making stories
small films that maybe will go to some

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:50.640
